---
---
<section class="py-24 bg-stone-50">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 font-semibold text-xs px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
        Demostración en video
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-4">
        Ve el sistema para pizzerías operando en tiempo real
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Descubre lo rápido que es generar pedidos, registrar clientes e imprimir tickets desde el mostrador de tu pizzería.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Contenedor del Video -->
    <div class="relative bg-stone-900 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-video border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center group">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.06] pointer-events-none" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #ffffff 1.5px, transparent 1.5px); background-size: 22px 22px;"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-stone-900/70 group-hover:bg-stone-900/60 transition-colors cursor-pointer">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-orange-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg text-white mb-4 transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 translate-x-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-white font-bold text-lg">Reproducir video del sistema para pizzerías</p>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Demostración rápida de operación de mostrador</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>